# After the IMR accepts (imr-accept.cdp), the requesting office uploads the
# DCR the approving authority signed; the package goes to the custodian.
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
? click button | Sign out
nav http://127.0.0.1:5173/
type #login-username | verify_enc
type #login-password | Verify-scratch-pass!
click button[type=submit] | 
wait Proposals
click .nav-item | Proposals
wait VRF 1.01
click .series-row | VRF 1.01
wait Once the approving authority has signed
shot 50-approval-awaited
upload #scan-approved_dcr | ${SCRATCH}/signed-dcr.pdf
wait With the Document Custodian.
shot 51-with-custodian
errors
